ontent":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RomulusGloriosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1039969-supernatural-video-games?p=1066406#post1066406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It <i>used to be good, </i>Atamajakki. It <i>used to be good</i>.<br /> <br /> :'( :'( :'(</div> </div> </div> </div>Unpopular opinion: AC1 is the best game in the franchise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T10:12:06-07:00","id":1066420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1039969-supernatural-video-games?p=1066417#post1066417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unpopular opinion: AC1 is the best game in the franchise.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought <i>Rogue </i>was the best one, followed by 3, so I'm not in a position to argue with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T10:14:06-07:00","id":1066423,"title":"","content":"My favorite Assassin's Creed is 3, then Brotherhood, then Liberation. I liked 1 when it came out but I find it hard to play nowadays. It felt more like a tech demo than a polished game experience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T10:30:35-07:00","id":1066436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RomulusGloriosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1039969-supernatural-video-games?p=1066420#post1066420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought <i>Rogue </i>was the best one, followed by 3, so I'm not in a position to argue with you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Rogue was a lot of fun (and that soundtrack!!), but I wish it had put more into showing the Templars as possibly having a point instead of just making the Assassins out to be idiots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T10:38:40-07:00","id":1066444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1039969-supernatural-video-games?p=1066436#post1066436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rogue was a lot of fun (and that soundtrack!!), but I wish it had put more into showing the Templars as possibly having a point instead of just making the Assassins out to be idiots.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah it did have a weird bit of dissonance with the Assassins - &quot;I got the artifact and it <i>killed millions of people</i>&quot; &quot;sacrifices must be made for the greater good. DO YOU WANT THE TEMPLARS TO WIN??&quot; - that didn't seem to fit with their behavior in other games. But I thought it did do a good job of showing the Templars in a good light, focusing on how they use their wealth and power to create stable, lasting institutions. It leads into Haytham's yelling at Connor in 3 with &quot;when was the last time the Assassins did anything but kill Templars?&quot; But even without the story, I felt Rogue was the most fun to play. (and yes, that soundtrack.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T19:32:40-07:00","id":1066676,"title":"","content":"Batman Arkham Knight! created a whole thread just for it once. and how good of inspiration it is for wraith<br /> <br /> <b>Spoilers Below ALERT!!! ALERT!!! ALERT!!!</b><br /> <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Throughout most of the Main body of the game Joker keeps appearing as a hallucination of Batmans. taunting him goading him...<br /> <br /> At the end Batman puts the Joker through a harrowing, pretty rich in symbolism.<br /> <br /> the add on that lets you play harley quin, the left over voice of the good doctor harleen quinzel seems excellent inspiration for a spectres psyche.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 03-22-2017, 10:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-30T00:57:38-07:00","id":1098374,"title":"","content":"\u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Does anyone know any good Supernatural Video Games? </div> </div> </div>The Sims series, including:<ul><li>The Sims Makin' Magic</li> <li>The Sims 3: Late Night</li> <li>The Sims 3: Supernatural</li> <li>The Sims 4: Vampires</li> </ul><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That is to say where you actually control a supernatural, not just a human fighting them. </div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u2611 check</div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> By supernatural I mean Vampire, Werewolf, Demon, Magic-caster, stuff like that. </div> </div> </div>all except for Demon:<div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u2611 check</div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Supernatural game that even gets close in quality to Bloodlines </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-size:13px\">from technical side of view, The Sims doesn't need to be patched-to-death to be playable, like Bloodlines do, so I consider it as:</span><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u2611 check</span></div><hr />Personally I really love The Sims for it's supernatural addons, latest &quot;Vampires&quot; is pretty detailed and nicely done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>[avatar artwork and character are by awesome goattrain]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13487-renha","name":"Renha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-30T15:07:51-07:00","id":1098577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1039969-supernatural-video-games?p=1066400#post1066400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If only it was good.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Black Flag was great. But then, it wasn't really an Assassin's Creed game. It was a pirate game that just happens to take place in the Assassin Creed's universe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l